WEBVTT

44:33.197 --> 44:35.032
Winter is coming.

44:36.659 --> 44:38.452
Winter is coming.

44:38.577 --> 44:39.995
(THEY CHUCKLE)

44:40.120 --> 44:42.957
- Uncle Benjen.
- Robb boy.

44:43.082 --> 44:44.541
- How are you?
- I'm good.

44:44.667 --> 44:46.919
(LAUGHTER)

44:48.003 --> 44:50.756
Is this your first time
in the North, Your Grace?

44:50.881 --> 44:53.634
Yes. Lovely country.

44:57.429 --> 45:00.766
I'm sure it's very grim
after King's Landing.
